## Deployment

The Helm chart lives in [`helm-chart/`](./helm-chart/). Lint it with:

```sh
helm lint helm-chart
helm template helm-chart --set jwt.issuerUri=<issuer-url> --set database.url=<jdbc-url> --set database.username=<user> | less
```

